{"id":"sbuild-abort.1","n":"sbuild-abort","s":"1","src":{"u":{"pkg":"sbuild","ver":"0.81.2ubuntu6.1","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/s/sbuild/sbuild_0.81.2ubuntu6.1_all.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/sbuild-abort.1.gz","sha256":"05e3d44a9ab043450a19b46e1778bedcd4dfe57afe4cb43c0e4c1b5fe74c2a8d","date":"15 December 2024","origin":"Version 0.81.2ubuntu6.1"}},"nopt":{"u":2},"desc":"abort the current sbuild build","u":[["NAME","<p>sbuild-abort - abort the current sbuild build</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>sbuild-abort</b> [<b>-h</b>|<b>--help</b> | <b>-V</b>|<b>--version</b>] <br> <b>buildd-abort</b> [<b>-h</b>|<b>--help</b> | <b>-V</b>|<b>--version</b>]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>sbuild-abort</b> kills the currently running <i>dpkg-buildpackage</i> process. It will not kill if more than one process is found.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<h3>Actions</h3> <dl><dt data-o=\"\" data-g=\"Actions\"><b>-h</b>, <b>--help</b></dt><dd>Display this manual.</dd><dt data-o=\"\" data-g=\"Actions\"><b>-V</b>, <b>--version</b></dt><dd>Print version information.</dd></dl>"],["EXAMPLES","<p>To abort the current build:</p> <p>% <b>sbuild-abort</b><b>↵</b> <br></p>"],["AUTHORS","<pre>Roman Hodek.\nRyan Murray.\nRoger Leigh.</pre>"],["COPYRIGHT","<pre>Copyright © 1998 Roman Hodek &lt;Roman.Hodek@informatik.uni-erlangen.de&gt;.\nCopyright © 2003 Ryan Murray &lt;rmurray@debian.org&gt;.\nCopyright © 2006–2008 Roger Leigh &lt;rleigh@debian.org&gt;.</pre>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>sbuild</b>(1).</p>"]]}